cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you build on Motion Studio or use it in your work, please cite it as below.
  Videos made with Motion Studio don't need a citation, but "Made with Motion
  Studio" is appreciated.
type: software
title: "Motion Studio"
abstract: >-
  An agent plugin that makes motion-graphics videos as code: brief and
  storyboard, a deterministic HTML/SVG/Canvas/Three.js composition, frame-exact
  headless rendering in every format, synced sound effects and an automated QA pass.
authors:
  - family-names: Sarupuri
    given-names: Sailalith
repository-code: "https://github.com/sarupurisailalith/motion-studio"
url: "https://github.com/sarupurisailalith/motion-studio"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.2.2
date-released: 2026-10-15
keywords:
  - motion graphics
  - video
  - animation
  - claude code
  - plugin
  - ffmpeg
  - playwright
